{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪が治りません(；д；)\n鼻水かみすぎて耳が痛いです(；д；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ治りたいです(＾∀＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月最後の日は東京ビッグサイトで握手会でしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪の為マスク着用しながらの握手でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"咳でるは鼻声だわでなんかすみませんね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも皆さんすごいポジティブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかお布団かぶりながらでてきたみたいだね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こたつに入ってるみたいだね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新鮮だよっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪が治る方法を調べてきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しい言葉をかけてくださいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎるーむできたルームウェア"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マスクの中はこんな顔してたのよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今テレビに8.6秒バズーカさんでてる〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラッスンゴレライ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとり二役できる様に練習中ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビにはどんどん面白いひと出てくるね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪上生駒最強伝説は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実話だってことを皆さんに是非目撃してもらいたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキー行きたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキー行った後の温泉と、休憩中に食べるラーメンは最高！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リフト乗ってるときに食べる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポッケに入れてたチョコを食べるのも好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の恵方巻きはジバニャンの恵方巻きだよん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジバニャンのロールケーキも注文した！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"録画してる妖怪ウォッチ見ながら食べよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/02/8305065/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}